<p><strong>Have data you want to submit to <% our $T3_INSTANCE_NAME %>?</strong></p>
<p>Use the data submission form below to send us your data.  You can send us data in any format and we will format it into upload templates, check for common errors, and upload it to the database for you.</p>

<a href="<% our $T3_SANDBOX_URL %>/guides/data-submission" class="btn btn-primary btn-block">Submit Data</a>

<br /><hr /><br />

<p>If you would like to try submitting data yourself to this sandbox instance, follow the instructions in the links below.  In order for the data to be included in the primary production database, please submit your data to us using the form above once it is ready.</p>


